{================================================================================
 Script Name : _Research_InsideBarBreak_v0.3
 MC Load Name: STRATEGY_GEN_InsideBarBreak
 Description : Daily Inside Bar Breakout (Bidirectional, MA-filtered)
 Version     : v0.5 (Long_Only_Mode + TargetMult 1.5->1.0 based on MC evidence)
 Symbol      : TXF1 (Taiwan Stock Index Futures Front Month)
 Platform    : MultiCharts 9.0 PowerLanguage x64
 Timeframe   : Data1 = 30M / Data2 = Daily
 Category    : B (Pattern Breakout) — predicted Swing-Trend
 Direction   : Bidirectional (Long when MA up, Short when MA down)

 CHANGELOG:
   v0.1   (archive batch01 Python proxy backtest)
          34 trades, WR 64.7%, PF 4.61 (^TWII daily proxy, NOT MC-verified)

   v0.2   (2026-06-17 Phase 1 reactivation)
          + Settlement_Flat (v_Settlement_Day, 1230 trigger)
          + HolidayFlat_v3 (63-date TAIFEX registry)
          + Manual_Kill_Switch + Registry_Valid_Until
          + LE_/SE_/LX_/SX_ label standardization
          Entry/exit alpha logic UNCHANGED.

   v0.3   (2026-06-17 B+C SOP completion)
          User directive: "糟糕的設計不管回測多少次都是糟糕的東西"
          Issues solved: B-1~4 + C-1~4 (8 of 29 in issue tracker)

          B-1  Dynamic BreakOffset = MotherRange × BreakOffset_Pct%
               (min MinBreakOffset). Small-vol days small offset,
               big-vol days big offset. v0.2 fixed 5pt is too weak
               on 400pt mother bars. BreakOffset_Mode(1)=dynamic,
               BreakOffset_Mode(0)=v0.2 fixed.

          B-2  ConfirmBars(2) require N consecutive bars holding
               above MotherHigh+offset before entry. Filters out
               "break + immediate reverse" bull/bear traps.
               Cost: delays entry by ~30min (1 bar).
               Switch: Confirm_On(true).

          B-3  Volume > Volume_MA(VolMALen) × VolMultiplier.
               Real breakouts come with volume surge; fake ones
               are quiet. CAVEAT: requires TXF1 Volume data
               available on 30M chart. Switch: VolFilter_On(true).

          B-4  Covered by B-2 (ConfirmBars >= 2 inherently
               excludes fast-reversal patterns).

          C-1  Break Even (BE): when peak profit >= MotherRange ×
               BE_Trigger_Pct%, lift SL to EntryPrice. Switch:
               BE_On(true). NOTE: L1/L2 BE was withdrawn for
               trend strategies; S2 is "early breakout" where
               false-breakout risk > trend-cut risk, so BE
               should still help here (pending Phase 2 verify).

          C-2  Trailing Stop: activates when peak profit >=
               TargetDist × Trail_Trigger_Pct%; tracks
               HighestClose - MotherRange × Trail_Offset_Pct%.
               Lets profit run beyond Fixed TP (1.5 × MotherRange).
               Switch: Trail_On(true).

          C-3  Stop Profit (ported from L1 V2.6 SECTION 12 logic):
               peak profit >= MotherRange × SP_Trigger_Mult arms;
               lock = Entry + peak × (1 - SP_GiveBack_Pct%).
               Switch: SP_On(true).

          C-4  4-layer Final_SL = Max(Frozen, BE, SP, Trail).
               Source identification via label: LX_IB_SL /
               LX_IB_BE / LX_IB_SP / LX_IB_Trail.
               Short side mirrors with SX_ prefix.

          ALL switches default to ON (true) for v0.3 deployment.
          Set all _On switches to false + BreakOffset_Mode=0
          to recreate exact v0.2 behavior for A/B testing.

   v0.4   (2026-06-17 A series: vol-compression quantification)
          Issues solved (3 of remaining 21): A-1, A-2, A-3.

          A-1  Inside / Mother range ratio filter. Pattern alone
               (v0.3) doesn't measure compression STRENGTH. A 50pt
               mother + 40pt inside bar = "weak" compression (80%).
               A 200pt mother + 50pt inside bar = "strong" (25%).
               Now requires v_CompressionRatio <= MaxCompressionRatio
               (default 0.6 = inside must be <= 60% of mother).
               Switch: Compression_On(true).

          A-2  Bollinger Band Width contraction filter. BB Width =
               2 * StdDev / Mid line. Requires current BB Width on
               Data2 (Daily) < historical 60-day avg * 0.8. Ensures
               we're in a *relatively* compressed regime, not just
               normal low-vol state. Switch: BB_Filter_On(true).

          A-3  Short ATR / Long ATR ratio filter. Requires ATR(5) <
               ATR(20) * 0.8 on Data2. Confirms ACCELERATING
               compression (recent 5 days tighter than past 20).
               Independent dimension from A-1 (pattern) and A-2
               (range). Switch: ATR_Filter_On(true).

          All three filters input-switched. Set all _On = false to
          recreate v0.3 behavior for A/B testing.

          Expected sample reduction: v0.3 ~5-8/yr -> v0.4 ~2-4/yr.
          Quality-over-quantity philosophy taken to maximum.

          REMAINING ISSUES (18/29): D-1~5 (no MC backtest yet),
          E-1~3 (alpha decay), F-1~3 (correlation), G-1~3 (MTF),
          H-1~2 (long/short asymmetry), I-1~3 (MFE/MAE).

   v0.5   (2026-06-17 Long_Only_Mode + TargetMult cut) ★ THIS VERSION
          First MC backtest (Naive 5.6yr) revealed:
            - Overall PF -0.92 (loses money)
            - Long-only PF 1.057 (barely)
            - Short-only PF 0.672 (no alpha)
            - TP hit rate only 19% (TargetMult 1.5 too far)
          Issues solved (H-1, H-2):

          H-1  Long/Short asymmetry confirmed. New input
               Long_Only_Mode(true) gates the Short entry
               block entirely. Short logic preserved but
               only triggers when Long_Only_Mode = false.

          H-2  Bear-market only Short worked (2022 +127K)
               but rest of years Short -280K. Long_Only_Mode
               accepts the asymmetry; we rely on L2/L4 in
               portfolio for downside protection.

          PERF FIX (not a tracked issue but raised by MC):
               TargetMult default 1.5 -> 1.0. v0.4's 1.5 had
               only 19% TP hit rate; 1.0 should raise it to
               ~40-50% based on MFE distribution analysis.

          Mathematical trade-off:
               Old: WR 43% × 3:1 RR = +0.72 expected/trade
               New: WR ~50% × 2:1 RR = +0.50 expected/trade
               But: less hold time = less slippage cost =
                    cleaner realized PnL.

          Rationale in: S2_why_long_bias_works.md

          REMAINING ISSUES (16/29): D-1~5 (no MC backtest yet),
          E-1~3 (alpha decay, partially answered by Naive PF data),
          F-1~3 (correlation), G-1~3 (MTF), I-1~3 (MFE/MAE).
================================================================================}

inputs:
    { ===== Strategy Core (v0.2 unchanged) ===== }
    BreakOffset(5),         { v0.2 fixed offset, retained for Mode=0 }
    StopPct(50),
    TargetMult(1.0),        { v0.5: was 1.5, reduced based on MC TP hit rate 19% }
    MinMotherRange(50),
    MaxMotherRange(400),
    MALen(20),
    MaxBarsHeld(30),
    MinStopPts(40),

    { ===== Priority 0 Protection (v0.2) ===== }
    Holiday_Flat_Time(415),
    Registry_Valid_Until(1270101),
    Manual_Kill_Switch(false),
    Settlement_Flat_Time(1230),

    { ===== v0.3 B series: false-breakout filters ===== }
    BreakOffset_Mode(1),      { 0=fixed v0.2, 1=dynamic v0.3 }
    BreakOffset_Pct(5),       { B-1: dynamic offset = MotherRange × this% }
    MinBreakOffset(5),        { B-1: floor for dynamic offset }
    Confirm_On(true),         { B-2: enable confirm-bars filter }
    ConfirmBars(2),           { B-2: require N consecutive bars holding }
    VolFilter_On(true),       { B-3: enable volume filter }
    VolMALen(20),             { B-3: volume MA length }
    VolMultiplier(1.2),       { B-3: volume must exceed MA × this }

    { ===== v0.3 C series: 4-layer SL protection ===== }
    BE_On(true),              { C-1: enable break-even }
    BE_Trigger_Pct(75),       { C-1: arm BE at peak >= MotherRange × this% }
    Trail_On(true),           { C-2: enable trailing stop }
    Trail_Trigger_Pct(70),    { C-2: arm trail at peak >= TargetDist × this% }
    Trail_Offset_Pct(30),     { C-2: trail offset = MotherRange × this% }
    SP_On(true),              { C-3: enable stop profit }
    SP_Trigger_Mult(1.0),     { C-3: arm SP at peak >= MotherRange × this }
    SP_GiveBack_Pct(45),      { C-3: allowed giveback from peak % }

    { ===== v0.4 A series: volatility compression quantification ===== }
    Compression_On(true),       { A-1: enable inside/mother ratio filter }
    MaxCompressionRatio(0.6),   { A-1: inside/mother <= this passes }

    BB_Filter_On(true),         { A-2: enable BB Width contraction }
    BB_Length(20),              { A-2: BB calculation length (Daily) }
    BB_StdDev_Mult(2),          { A-2: BB std-dev multiplier }
    BB_AvgLen(60),              { A-2: history avg length for comparison }
    BB_Width_Threshold(0.8),    { A-2: current BB Width < avg × this passes }

    ATR_Filter_On(true),        { A-3: enable ATR short/long contraction }
    ATR_Short_Len(5),           { A-3: short ATR length (Daily) }
    ATR_Long_Len(20),           { A-3: long ATR length (Daily) }
    ATR_Compression_Threshold(0.8),  { A-3: ATR_Short < ATR_Long × this passes }

    { ===== v0.5 H series: Long/Short asymmetry handling ===== }
    Long_Only_Mode(true);       { H-1: true = block all Short entries
                                  Default true based on MC evidence:
                                  Naive Long PF 1.057 / Short PF 0.672
                                  Set false to restore v0.4 bidirectional }

variables:
    { ===== Strategy Core (v0.2) ===== }
    v_IsInsideBar(false),
    v_MotherHigh(0),
    v_MotherLow(0),
    v_MotherRange(0),
    v_StopDist(0),
    v_TargetDist(0),
    v_MA_Up(false),
    v_MA_Down(false),
    v_EntryBar(0),
    v_Prev_MP(0),

    { ===== Priority 0 (v0.2) ===== }
    v_Holiday_Block(false),
    v_Registry_Expired(false),
    v_Settlement_Day(false),
    Registry_Warn_ID(-1),
    hidx(0),

    { ===== v0.3 B series ===== }
    v_DynBreakOffset(0),       { B-1: computed dynamic offset }
    v_VolMA(0),                { B-3: volume MA }
    v_VolPass(false),          { B-3: volume passed }
    v_PendingLong(false),      { B-2: long waiting confirmation }
    v_PendingShort(false),     { B-2: short waiting confirmation }
    v_PendingLong_Bars(0),     { B-2: bars held above breakout }
    v_PendingShort_Bars(0),    { B-2: bars held below breakdown }

    { ===== v0.3 C series - Long ===== }
    v_HighestClose(0),         { peak close since entry (Long) }
    v_Peak_Profit_L(0),        { peak profit pts (Long) }
    v_Frozen_SL_L(0),          { Layer 0: locked initial SL }
    v_SL_Locked_L(false),
    v_BE_Armed_L(false),       { Layer 1: BE armed }
    v_BE_Level_L(0),
    v_Trail_Armed_L(false),    { Layer 3: Trail armed }
    v_Trail_Level_L(0),
    v_SP_Armed_L(false),       { Layer 2: SP armed }
    v_SP_Level_L(0),
    v_Final_SL_L(0),           { Max of all 4 layers }

    { ===== v0.3 C series - Short (mirror) ===== }
    v_LowestClose(99999999),
    v_Peak_Profit_S(0),
    v_Frozen_SL_S(0),
    v_SL_Locked_S(false),
    v_BE_Armed_S(false),
    v_BE_Level_S(0),
    v_Trail_Armed_S(false),
    v_Trail_Level_S(0),
    v_SP_Armed_S(false),
    v_SP_Level_S(0),
    v_Final_SL_S(0),

    { ===== v0.4 A series: volatility compression vars ===== }
    v_InsideRange(0),          { A-1: Inside Bar range }
    v_CompressionRatio(0),     { A-1: Inside / Mother ratio }
    v_Compression_Pass(false), { A-1: passes filter }

    v_BB_StdDev(0),            { A-2: BB std dev }
    v_BB_Mid(0),               { A-2: BB mid line }
    v_BB_Width(0),             { A-2: current BB Width }
    v_BB_Width_Avg(0),         { A-2: historical avg }
    v_BB_Pass(false),          { A-2: passes filter }

    v_ATR_Short(0),            { A-3: short ATR }
    v_ATR_Long(0),             { A-3: long ATR }
    v_ATR_Pass(false);         { A-3: passes filter }

arrays:
    Holiday_Tail[80](0);

{ ============================================================================
  0. Holiday Tail Registry (TAIFEX-verified, shared with L1-L5)
  ============================================================================ }

if CurrentBar = 1 then begin
    Holiday_Tail[1]  = 1190913;  Holiday_Tail[2]  = 1191010;
    Holiday_Tail[3]  = 1200101;
    Holiday_Tail[4]  = 1200121;  Holiday_Tail[5]  = 1200228;
    Holiday_Tail[6]  = 1200402;  Holiday_Tail[7]  = 1200501;
    Holiday_Tail[8]  = 1200625;  Holiday_Tail[9]  = 1201001;
    Holiday_Tail[10] = 1201009;  Holiday_Tail[11] = 1210101;
    Holiday_Tail[12] = 1210206;  Holiday_Tail[13] = 1210227;
    Holiday_Tail[14] = 1210402;  Holiday_Tail[15] = 1210612;
    Holiday_Tail[16] = 1210918;  Holiday_Tail[17] = 1211009;
    Holiday_Tail[18] = 1211231;
    Holiday_Tail[19] = 1220127;  Holiday_Tail[20] = 1220226;
    Holiday_Tail[21] = 1220402;  Holiday_Tail[22] = 1220430;
    Holiday_Tail[23] = 1220603;  Holiday_Tail[24] = 1220909;
    Holiday_Tail[25] = 1221008;  Holiday_Tail[26] = 1221231;
    Holiday_Tail[27] = 1230118;  Holiday_Tail[28] = 1230225;
    Holiday_Tail[29] = 1230401;  Holiday_Tail[30] = 1230429;
    Holiday_Tail[31] = 1230622;  Holiday_Tail[32] = 1230929;
    Holiday_Tail[33] = 1231007;  Holiday_Tail[34] = 1231230;
    Holiday_Tail[35] = 1240206;  Holiday_Tail[36] = 1240228;
    Holiday_Tail[37] = 1240404;  Holiday_Tail[38] = 1240501;
    Holiday_Tail[39] = 1240608;  Holiday_Tail[40] = 1240917;
    Holiday_Tail[41] = 1241010;  Holiday_Tail[42] = 1250101;
    Holiday_Tail[43] = 1250123;  Holiday_Tail[44] = 1250228;
    Holiday_Tail[45] = 1250403;  Holiday_Tail[46] = 1250501;
    Holiday_Tail[47] = 1250530;  Holiday_Tail[48] = 1250927;
    Holiday_Tail[49] = 1251004;  Holiday_Tail[50] = 1251010;
    Holiday_Tail[51] = 1251024;  Holiday_Tail[52] = 1251225;
    Holiday_Tail[53] = 1260101;
    Holiday_Tail[54] = 1260212;  Holiday_Tail[55] = 1260227;
    Holiday_Tail[56] = 1260403;  Holiday_Tail[57] = 1260501;
    Holiday_Tail[58] = 1260619;  Holiday_Tail[59] = 1260925;
    Holiday_Tail[60] = 1261009;  Holiday_Tail[61] = 1261024;
    Holiday_Tail[62] = 1261225;  Holiday_Tail[63] = 1270101;
end;

{ ============================================================================
  1. Holiday / Registry / Settlement detection (v0.2 unchanged)
  ============================================================================ }
v_Holiday_Block = false;
if Time <= 500 then begin
    for hidx = 1 to 80 begin
        if Date = Holiday_Tail[hidx] then
            v_Holiday_Block = true;
    end;
end;

if Date > Registry_Valid_Until then begin
    v_Registry_Expired = true;
    v_Holiday_Block    = true;
end;

v_Settlement_Day = (DayOfWeek(Date) = 3) and
                   (DayOfMonth(Date) >= 15) and
                   (DayOfMonth(Date) <= 21);

{ ============================================================================
  2. Inside Bar detection (v0.2 unchanged)
  ============================================================================ }
v_IsInsideBar = (High of Data2[1] < High of Data2[2]) and
                (Low of Data2[1] > Low of Data2[2]);

v_MotherHigh = High of Data2[2];
v_MotherLow  = Low of Data2[2];
v_MotherRange = v_MotherHigh - v_MotherLow;

v_MA_Up   = Close of Data2[1] > Average(Close of Data2, MALen)[1];
v_MA_Down = Close of Data2[1] < Average(Close of Data2, MALen)[1];

v_StopDist   = MaxList(v_MotherRange * StopPct / 100, MinStopPts);
v_TargetDist = v_MotherRange * TargetMult;

{ ============================================================================
  3a. v0.4 A-1: Inside / Mother Range ratio
  ============================================================================ }
v_InsideRange = High of Data2[1] - Low of Data2[1];
if v_MotherRange > 0 then
    v_CompressionRatio = v_InsideRange / v_MotherRange
else
    v_CompressionRatio = 999;
if Compression_On = false then
    v_Compression_Pass = true
else
    v_Compression_Pass = (v_CompressionRatio <= MaxCompressionRatio);

{ ============================================================================
  3b. v0.4 A-2: BB Width contraction on Data2 (Daily)
  ============================================================================ }
v_BB_StdDev    = StdDev(Close of Data2, BB_Length);
v_BB_Mid       = Average(Close of Data2, BB_Length);
if v_BB_Mid > 0 then
    v_BB_Width = (v_BB_StdDev * 2 * BB_StdDev_Mult) / v_BB_Mid
else
    v_BB_Width = 999;
v_BB_Width_Avg = Average(v_BB_Width, BB_AvgLen);
if BB_Filter_On = false then
    v_BB_Pass = true
else if v_BB_Width_Avg > 0 then
    v_BB_Pass = (v_BB_Width < v_BB_Width_Avg * BB_Width_Threshold)
else
    v_BB_Pass = true;

{ ============================================================================
  3c. v0.4 A-3: Short ATR / Long ATR contraction
  ============================================================================ }
v_ATR_Short = AvgTrueRange(ATR_Short_Len) of Data2;
v_ATR_Long  = AvgTrueRange(ATR_Long_Len) of Data2;
if ATR_Filter_On = false then
    v_ATR_Pass = true
else if v_ATR_Long > 0 then
    v_ATR_Pass = (v_ATR_Short < v_ATR_Long * ATR_Compression_Threshold)
else
    v_ATR_Pass = true;

{ ============================================================================
  3. v0.3 B-1: Dynamic BreakOffset
  ============================================================================ }
if BreakOffset_Mode = 1 then
    v_DynBreakOffset = MaxList(v_MotherRange * BreakOffset_Pct / 100,
                                MinBreakOffset)
else
    v_DynBreakOffset = BreakOffset;   { v0.2 mode }

{ ============================================================================
  4. v0.3 B-3: Volume filter
  ============================================================================ }
v_VolMA = Average(Volume, VolMALen);
if VolFilter_On = false then
    v_VolPass = true
else if v_VolMA > 0 and Volume > v_VolMA * VolMultiplier then
    v_VolPass = true
else
    v_VolPass = false;

{ ============================================================================
  5. v0.3 B-2: Two-stage entry with ConfirmBars
  Stage 1: breakout detected -> mark pending
  Stage 2: subsequent bars must hold; if N bars hold -> enter
           if any bar pulls back -> cancel
  ============================================================================ }

{ Long: stage 1 detection (only when flat and gates pass) }
if v_Prev_MP <= 0 and v_PendingLong = false and v_PendingShort = false and
   v_IsInsideBar and
   v_MotherRange >= MinMotherRange and
   v_MotherRange <= MaxMotherRange and
   v_Compression_Pass and       { A-1: inside/mother ratio }
   v_BB_Pass and                { A-2: BB Width contraction }
   v_ATR_Pass and               { A-3: ATR short/long contraction }
   v_MA_Up and
   v_Holiday_Block = false and
   v_Settlement_Day = false and
   v_Registry_Expired = false and
   v_VolPass and
   Close > v_MotherHigh + v_DynBreakOffset then begin
    if Confirm_On = false then begin
        { No confirmation: immediate entry, same as v0.2 }
        buy ("LE_IB_Entry") next bar at market;
        v_EntryBar = BarNumber;
    end else begin
        { Confirmation required: mark pending }
        v_PendingLong = true;
        v_PendingLong_Bars = 1;
    end;
end;

{ Long: stage 2 confirmation }
if v_PendingLong then begin
    if Close > v_MotherHigh then begin
        v_PendingLong_Bars = v_PendingLong_Bars + 1;
        if v_PendingLong_Bars >= ConfirmBars then begin
            buy ("LE_IB_Entry") next bar at market;
            v_EntryBar = BarNumber;
            v_PendingLong = false;
            v_PendingLong_Bars = 0;
        end;
    end else begin
        { Pull-back: cancel pending }
        v_PendingLong = false;
        v_PendingLong_Bars = 0;
    end;
end;

{ Short: stage 1 detection (only if Long_Only_Mode = false) }
if Long_Only_Mode = false and    { v0.5 H-1 gate }
   v_Prev_MP >= 0 and v_PendingShort = false and v_PendingLong = false and
   v_IsInsideBar and
   v_MotherRange >= MinMotherRange and
   v_MotherRange <= MaxMotherRange and
   v_Compression_Pass and       { A-1: inside/mother ratio }
   v_BB_Pass and                { A-2: BB Width contraction }
   v_ATR_Pass and               { A-3: ATR short/long contraction }
   v_MA_Down and
   v_Holiday_Block = false and
   v_Settlement_Day = false and
   v_Registry_Expired = false and
   v_VolPass and
   Close < v_MotherLow - v_DynBreakOffset then begin
    if Confirm_On = false then begin
        sell short ("SE_IB_Entry") next bar at market;
        v_EntryBar = BarNumber;
    end else begin
        v_PendingShort = true;
        v_PendingShort_Bars = 1;
    end;
end;

{ Short: stage 2 confirmation }
if v_PendingShort then begin
    if Close < v_MotherLow then begin
        v_PendingShort_Bars = v_PendingShort_Bars + 1;
        if v_PendingShort_Bars >= ConfirmBars then begin
            sell short ("SE_IB_Entry") next bar at market;
            v_EntryBar = BarNumber;
            v_PendingShort = false;
            v_PendingShort_Bars = 0;
        end;
    end else begin
        v_PendingShort = false;
        v_PendingShort_Bars = 0;
    end;
end;

{ ============================================================================
  6. v0.3 C-1~C-4: 4-layer SL protection - LONG side
  ============================================================================ }
if MarketPosition = 1 then begin

    { Layer 0: Frozen Initial SL (lock at entry bar) }
    if v_SL_Locked_L = false then begin
        v_Frozen_SL_L = EntryPrice - v_StopDist;
        v_SL_Locked_L = true;
        v_HighestClose = Close;
    end;

    { Track peak close }
    if Close > v_HighestClose then v_HighestClose = Close;
    v_Peak_Profit_L = v_HighestClose - EntryPrice;

    { Layer 1: BE (Break Even) }
    if BE_On and v_BE_Armed_L = false and
       v_Peak_Profit_L >= v_MotherRange * BE_Trigger_Pct / 100 then
        v_BE_Armed_L = true;
    if v_BE_Armed_L then
        v_BE_Level_L = EntryPrice
    else
        v_BE_Level_L = 0;

    { Layer 2: SP (Stop Profit, L1 V2.6 ported) }
    if SP_On and v_SP_Armed_L = false and
       v_Peak_Profit_L >= v_MotherRange * SP_Trigger_Mult then
        v_SP_Armed_L = true;
    if v_SP_Armed_L then
        v_SP_Level_L = EntryPrice +
                       v_Peak_Profit_L * (1 - SP_GiveBack_Pct / 100)
    else
        v_SP_Level_L = 0;

    { Layer 3: Trailing Stop }
    if Trail_On and v_Trail_Armed_L = false and
       v_Peak_Profit_L >= v_TargetDist * Trail_Trigger_Pct / 100 then
        v_Trail_Armed_L = true;
    if v_Trail_Armed_L then
        v_Trail_Level_L = v_HighestClose -
                          v_MotherRange * Trail_Offset_Pct / 100
    else
        v_Trail_Level_L = 0;

    { Final SL: highest (most protective) of 4 layers }
    v_Final_SL_L = MaxList(v_Frozen_SL_L,
                   MaxList(v_BE_Level_L,
                   MaxList(v_SP_Level_L, v_Trail_Level_L)));
end;

{ ============================================================================
  7. v0.3 C-1~C-4: 4-layer SL protection - SHORT side (mirror)
  ============================================================================ }
if MarketPosition = -1 then begin

    if v_SL_Locked_S = false then begin
        v_Frozen_SL_S = EntryPrice + v_StopDist;
        v_SL_Locked_S = true;
        v_LowestClose = Close;
    end;

    if Close < v_LowestClose then v_LowestClose = Close;
    v_Peak_Profit_S = EntryPrice - v_LowestClose;

    { BE: SL down to EntryPrice }
    if BE_On and v_BE_Armed_S = false and
       v_Peak_Profit_S >= v_MotherRange * BE_Trigger_Pct / 100 then
        v_BE_Armed_S = true;
    if v_BE_Armed_S then
        v_BE_Level_S = EntryPrice
    else
        v_BE_Level_S = 999999;   { neutral high so MinList picks others }

    { SP }
    if SP_On and v_SP_Armed_S = false and
       v_Peak_Profit_S >= v_MotherRange * SP_Trigger_Mult then
        v_SP_Armed_S = true;
    if v_SP_Armed_S then
        v_SP_Level_S = EntryPrice -
                       v_Peak_Profit_S * (1 - SP_GiveBack_Pct / 100)
    else
        v_SP_Level_S = 999999;

    { Trail }
    if Trail_On and v_Trail_Armed_S = false and
       v_Peak_Profit_S >= v_TargetDist * Trail_Trigger_Pct / 100 then
        v_Trail_Armed_S = true;
    if v_Trail_Armed_S then
        v_Trail_Level_S = v_LowestClose +
                          v_MotherRange * Trail_Offset_Pct / 100
    else
        v_Trail_Level_S = 999999;

    { Final SL: lowest (most protective for shorts) }
    v_Final_SL_S = MinList(v_Frozen_SL_S,
                   MinList(v_BE_Level_S,
                   MinList(v_SP_Level_S, v_Trail_Level_S)));
end;

{ ============================================================================
  8. Priority 0 Exit Chain - LONG side
  Order: Kill > RegistryEnd > HolFlat > Settlement > Strategy
  ============================================================================ }
if MarketPosition = 1 then begin

    if Manual_Kill_Switch then
        sell ("LX_IB_Kill") next bar at Market
    else if v_Registry_Expired then
        sell ("LX_IB_RegistryEnd") next bar at Market
    else if v_Holiday_Block and Time >= Holiday_Flat_Time then
        sell ("LX_IB_HolFlat") next bar at Market
    else if v_Settlement_Day and Time >= Settlement_Flat_Time then
        sell ("LX_IB_Settlement") next bar at Market
    else begin
        { Strategy exits: Final SL (4-layer) + TP + Time }
        if Close < v_Final_SL_L then
            sell ("LX_IB_SL_Gap") next bar at Market
        else begin
            if AbsValue(v_Final_SL_L - v_Frozen_SL_L) < 0.001 then
                sell ("LX_IB_SL") next bar at v_Final_SL_L stop
            else if v_SP_Armed_L and
                    AbsValue(v_Final_SL_L - v_SP_Level_L) < 0.001 then
                sell ("LX_IB_SP") next bar at v_Final_SL_L stop
            else if v_Trail_Armed_L and
                    AbsValue(v_Final_SL_L - v_Trail_Level_L) < 0.001 then
                sell ("LX_IB_Trail") next bar at v_Final_SL_L stop
            else
                sell ("LX_IB_BE") next bar at v_Final_SL_L stop;
        end;
        sell ("LX_IB_TP") next bar at EntryPrice + v_TargetDist limit;
        if BarNumber - v_EntryBar >= MaxBarsHeld then
            sell ("LX_IB_Time") next bar at market;
    end;
end;

{ ============================================================================
  9. Priority 0 Exit Chain - SHORT side (mirror)
  ============================================================================ }
if MarketPosition = -1 then begin

    if Manual_Kill_Switch then
        buy to cover ("SX_IB_Kill") next bar at Market
    else if v_Registry_Expired then
        buy to cover ("SX_IB_RegistryEnd") next bar at Market
    else if v_Holiday_Block and Time >= Holiday_Flat_Time then
        buy to cover ("SX_IB_HolFlat") next bar at Market
    else if v_Settlement_Day and Time >= Settlement_Flat_Time then
        buy to cover ("SX_IB_Settlement") next bar at Market
    else begin
        if Close > v_Final_SL_S then
            buy to cover ("SX_IB_SL_Gap") next bar at Market
        else begin
            if AbsValue(v_Final_SL_S - v_Frozen_SL_S) < 0.001 then
                buy to cover ("SX_IB_SL") next bar at v_Final_SL_S stop
            else if v_SP_Armed_S and
                    AbsValue(v_Final_SL_S - v_SP_Level_S) < 0.001 then
                buy to cover ("SX_IB_SP") next bar at v_Final_SL_S stop
            else if v_Trail_Armed_S and
                    AbsValue(v_Final_SL_S - v_Trail_Level_S) < 0.001 then
                buy to cover ("SX_IB_Trail") next bar at v_Final_SL_S stop
            else
                buy to cover ("SX_IB_BE") next bar at v_Final_SL_S stop;
        end;
        buy to cover ("SX_IB_TP") next bar at EntryPrice - v_TargetDist limit;
        if BarNumber - v_EntryBar >= MaxBarsHeld then
            buy to cover ("SX_IB_Time") next bar at market;
    end;
end;

{ ============================================================================
  10. Flat-state reset (release locks for next trade)
  ============================================================================ }
if MarketPosition = 0 then begin
    { Long }
    v_SL_Locked_L     = false;
    v_Frozen_SL_L     = 0;
    v_HighestClose    = 0;
    v_Peak_Profit_L   = 0;
    v_BE_Armed_L      = false;
    v_BE_Level_L      = 0;
    v_Trail_Armed_L   = false;
    v_Trail_Level_L   = 0;
    v_SP_Armed_L      = false;
    v_SP_Level_L      = 0;
    v_Final_SL_L      = 0;

    { Short }
    v_SL_Locked_S     = false;
    v_Frozen_SL_S     = 0;
    v_LowestClose     = 99999999;
    v_Peak_Profit_S   = 0;
    v_BE_Armed_S      = false;
    v_BE_Level_S      = 999999;
    v_Trail_Armed_S   = false;
    v_Trail_Level_S   = 999999;
    v_SP_Armed_S      = false;
    v_SP_Level_S      = 999999;
    v_Final_SL_S      = 999999;
end;

{ ============================================================================
  11. Previous-MarketPosition tracker (MUST be last line)
  ============================================================================ }
v_Prev_MP = MarketPosition;
